{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0649"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge music-stage/classical","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/music-stage__classical.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",940],["+","The youngest of the famous houses stands on Bennelong Point in Sydney Harbour. Jørn Utzon's Sydney Opera House, with its white sail-like shells, took fourteen years to build and cost many times its budget. Before Queen Elizabeth II formally opened it on 20 October 1973, the Australian Opera had already given the first opera in the new building on 28 September 1973: War and Peace (Prokofiev), Sergei Prokofiev's vast setting of Tolstoy's novel.\n\n"],["=",107],["+","\n| Sydney Opera House | Sydney | 1973 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",884],["+","Das jüngste der berühmten Häuser steht auf Bennelong Point im Hafen von Sydney. Jørn Utzons Sydney Opera House mit seinen weißen, segelartigen Schalen wurde in vierzehn Jahren gebaut und kostete ein Vielfaches des geplanten Budgets. Noch bevor Königin Elisabeth II. es am 20. Oktober 1973 feierlich eröffnete, gab die Australian Opera am 28. September 1973 die erste Oper im neuen Haus: Krieg und Frieden (Prokofjew), Sergei Prokofjews monumentale Vertonung von Tolstois Roman.\n\n"],["=",101],["+","\n| Sydney Opera House | Sydney | 1973 |"]]}]},
